(7467194, 1185438, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute picture and quote. But, wouldn''t that depend on the size of the lens, and the relative speeds of the subject and car?</td>', 'Cute picture and quote. But, wouldn''t that depend on the size of the lens, and the relative speeds of the subject and car?', '2016-08-05 15:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
