(7468204, 1185431, 114285, '<td valign="top">So I was just thinking about you the other day, shock horror hey ;) and then lo and behold you left me a very nice comment on my photo which I really appreciated. So anyway there you are swimming in the ocean taking awesome pictures of sea life, I really liked this one.<br/> <br/>   A big congrats.</td>', 'So I was just thinking about you the other day, shock horror hey ;) and then lo and behold you left me a very nice comment on my photo which I really appreciated. So anyway there you are swimming in the ocean taking awesome pictures of sea life, I really liked this one.    A big congrats.', '2016-08-12 01:33:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7468206, 1185475, 112828, '<td valign="top">Shocked this ended up down here....<br/> <br/>Your processing has really matured, I''m LOVING your recent work.</td>', 'Shocked this ended up down here.... Your processing has really matured, I''m LOVING your recent work.', '2016-08-12 02:04:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7468207, 1185453, 172697, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the nice comments and votes.<br/> <br/>I have to say I expected a bit more with this shot... Salgado is one of my favorite authors, I''m very fond of this quotation and I thought the picture expressed it well, in a "natural" way.<br/> <br/>Anyway, happy with the result.<br/> <br/>Cheers</td>', 'Thank you for the nice comments and votes. I have to say I expected a bit more with this shot... Salgado is one of my favorite authors, I''m very fond of this quotation and I thought the picture expressed it well, in a "natural" way. Anyway, happy with the result. Cheers', '2016-08-12 02:41:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7468208, 1185475, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cory:</b></div><hr/><i> Shocked this ended up down here....<br/> <br/>Your processing has really matured, I''m LOVING your recent work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah some people don''t know a good photo if they fell over it haha!<br/> <br/>BTW this is hardly edited!</td>', 'Originally posted by Cory: Shocked this ended up down here.... Your processing has really matured, I''m LOVING your recent work.   Yeah some people don''t know a good photo if they fell over it haha! BTW this is hardly edited!', '2016-08-12 02:46:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7468209, 1185475, 112828, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cory:</b></div><hr/><i> Shocked this ended up down here....<br/> <br/>Your processing has really matured, I''m LOVING your recent work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah some people don''t know a good photo if they fell over it haha!<br/> <br/>BTW this is hardly edited! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Is this one barely edited as well?  <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1184729" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1184729.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1184729.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2313/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1184729.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>''cause I really loved it too.   Whatever, not like your fishing image didn''t score predictably well, I just have never loved that style - I personally love these less touched images.  And you know, since you can really bloody shoot fantastically well, when you nail it, they don''t need much.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Originally posted by Cory: Shocked this ended up down here.... Your processing has really matured, I''m LOVING your recent work.   Yeah some people don''t know a good photo if they fell over it haha! BTW this is hardly edited!   Is this one barely edited as well?     ''cause I really loved it too.   Whatever, not like your fishing image didn''t score predictably well, I just have never loved that style - I personally love these less touched images.  And you know, since you can really bloody shoot fantastically well, when you nail it, they don''t need much.', '2016-08-12 02:50:24.000000', NULL, 0),
